source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The rule is one item of the list Jira keeps open, so jiro writes three items and the list survives the line.
-- input.jira --
* a
* ----
* b
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>a</li>
	<li><hr /></li>
	<li>b</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- a
- ***
- b
-- warnings.json --
[]
